{"reference":"Micah 7","book":"Micah","chapter":7,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"chapter_overview","title":"Overview","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Micah 7 moves through sharply different forms of speech: lament over broken social life, a declaration of watchful hope, address to an enemy, confession, prayer for the people, imagery concerning the nations, and closing praise. Readers need not assume that every line has the same speaker; the transitions are debated, but the chapter deliberately gathers these varied responses into its movement from distress toward forgiveness and covenant faithfulness.","verse_refs":["Micah 7:1-20"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_micah_007_2569c6533355be8fc5083f04"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]},{"kind":"interpretive_questions","title":"Questions of Formation and Reading","blocks":[{"id":"block_2","text":"Scholars generally see the book as preserving eighth-century prophetic material while also reflecting a lengthy process of collection and shaping; they disagree about the dates and extent of later layers. That uncertainty cautions against treating every feature of Micah 7 as if its compositional history were settled, while the final form clearly ends with praise of God’s forgiveness, compassion, and promises to Jacob and Abraham.","verse_refs":["Micah 7:1-20","Micah 7:18-20","Micah 7:20"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_micah_007_e890d32a5cb26f96b25c6604"],"confidence":"medium","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]},{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Within the Book of Micah","blocks":[{"id":"block_3","text":"One influential, though debated, reading sees Micah’s final form as repeatedly alternating judgment and hope across chapters 1–2, 3–5, and 6–7. In that larger pattern, the severe exposure of corruption and fracture in Micah 7 belongs alongside its later expressions of hope and mercy, rather than standing as the book’s final word.","verse_refs":["Micah 1:1-16","Micah 2:1-13","Micah 3:1-12","Micah 4:1-13","Micah 5:1-15","Micah 6:1-16"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_micah_007_74ee324e9fcfeb246cff840b"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}